BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Action: Dispatch durable billing events and allocate bank-confirmed receipts with unique identifiers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Detail: Compare earned revenue, delivery costs, cash collections, and open receivables before approving) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (the next month's capacity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (Start with a signed service schedule defining territory, buyer role, commercial need, exclusions, duplicate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (window, evidence standard, acceptance deadline, and dispute owner. A qualified appointment is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (interchangeable with an answered call: specify whether attendance, decision authority, or a documented) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (buying project creates the fee. For this chapter, five clients each purchase a $5,000 monthly service retainer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (plus $250 per finally accepted lead. The retainer covers campaign operations, reporting, and routing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (maintenance; the variable fee covers a separately evidenced delivery unit. Client-funded media stays) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (outside recognized operator revenue and preferably remains in client-owned advertising accounts. Record) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (authorization to use each domain, inbox, telephone number, CRM workspace, and destination calendar) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (before production access. In HubSpot or Salesforce, require a client identifier, source event identifier,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (service period, qualification fields, and evidence pointer. Store sensitive source material in a restricted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (evidence repository rather than free-text CRM notes. Assign one full-time owner to acceptance disputes and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (three contractors to research, delivery operations, and quality review. This allocation matches the Base) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (staffing envelope without assuming that contractor availability equals three additional full-time employees.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (Establish named backups before the first campaign creates a customer response.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (Build the acquisition lane around actual authorization, not around mailbox quantity. Configure SPF, DKIM,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (and DMARC for clearly identified sending domains using Google Workspace or Microsoft 365; separate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (client credentials and publish working reply addresses. Multiple inboxes provide operational segregation and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (capacity management, never a method for bypassing provider limits or recipient suppression. Under 15) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (U.S.C. ? 7704, commercial email requires accurate transmission information, nondeceptive subjects,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (applicable advertising identification, a valid postal address, and a functioning opt-out mechanism. Process) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (opt-outs immediately in operations even though the federal deadline generally permits ten business days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (Preserve suppression across every campaign acting for the same sender. Telephone and text permissions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (require a separate analysis under 47 U.S.C. ? 227 and 47 CFR ? 64.1200; a business job title does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (establish that a number is exempt from restrictions affecting wireless or residential recipients. Check state) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (calling and recording requirements before enabling dialing or call recording. Use CallRail or Twilio routing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (logs to prove delivery without assuming a recording is always available. When permission evidence is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (incomplete, stop that channel and offer a verified inbound form or explicitly requested callback instead.) Tj ET
